---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Sarkari Sahayak 2026"
  description="Sarkari Sahayak ki privacy policy — hum aapka data nahi collect karte, cookies sirf theme ke liye, koi tracking nahi."
  canonical="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">

      <div class="section-head center-head">
        <p class="section-label">Privacy</p>
        <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="section-sub">Last updated: January 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <p>
          <strong>Sarkari Sahayak</strong> aapki privacy ko seriously leta hai. Hum ek independent informational platform hain aur <strong>hum aapka koi personal data collect nahi karte.</strong> Yeh policy batati hai ki hum kya karte hain aur kya nahi karte.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Data Hum Collect Nahi Karte</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>No Account Required:</strong> Aapko koi account ya registration ki zaroorat nahi — sab kuch open hai</li>
          <li><strong>No Login Data:</strong> Hum aapka email, phone number, ya koi bhi personal identifier store nahi karte</li>
          <li><strong>No Form Data:</strong> Contact form ka data sirf email ke through aata hai — hum usse kisi database mein store nahi karte</li>
          <li><strong>No Browsing History Track:</strong> Hum aapki browsing activity, pages visited, ya clicks track nahi karte</li>
          <li><strong>No Analytics:</strong> Hum third-party analytics (Google Analytics, etc.) use nahi karte</li>
          <li><strong>No Advertising:</strong> Humari website pe koi ads nahi hain, isliye ad tracking bhi nahi hai</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Cookies &amp; localStorage</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Humari website sirf <strong>ek hi cheez ke liye cookies/localStorage use karti hai — Theme Selection</strong>. Jab aap Dark ya Light mode choose karte hain, toh woh preference aapke browser mein store hoti hai taaki agla visit pe woh same theme dikhe.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Storage Key:</strong> <code>ss-theme</code> — sirf "dark" ya "light" store karta hai</li>
          <li><strong>No Third-Party Cookies:</strong> Hum kisi third-party cookie ka use nahi karte</li>
          <li><strong>No Session Tracking:</strong> Hum aapke session ya visit ko track nahi karte</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Agar aap chahein toh apne browser se <code>ss-theme</code> key delete kar sakte hain — website phir bhi kaam karegi, bas default theme dikhegi.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Third-Party Links</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Humari website pe <strong>official government websites ke links</strong> hain — jaise uidai.gov.in, incometax.gov.in, rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in, etc. In links pe click karne pe aap <strong>third-party websites</strong> pe jaate hain jo ki sarkari websites hain.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Hum <strong>un sarkari websites ki privacy policies ka</strong> zimmedaar nahi hain</li>
          <li>Agar aap un websites pe jaate hain, toh unki privacy policy padhein</li>
          <li>Hum sirf <strong>official government domain</strong> ke links share karte hain — kisi bhi private portal ke nahi</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Children's Privacy</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Sarkari Sahayak kisi bhi tarah ka <strong>personal data collect nahi karta</strong> — chahe adult ho ya child. Isliye children's privacy ki alag se zaroorat nahi hai, par hum ek informational platform hain, isliye hum hamesha safe content provide karte hain.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Policy Changes</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Agar hum is privacy policy mein koi change karte hain, toh hum is page ko update kar denge. "Last updated" date dekhkar aap pata laga sakte hain ki policy kab update hui hai.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <span class="disc-icon">🛡️</span>
        <div class="disc-text">
          <strong>Summary:</strong> Sarkari Sahayak koi data collect nahi karta, koi analytics nahi lagata, koi ads nahi dikhata. Sirf theme preference store hoti hai — baaki sab bilkul safe aur private hai.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
